            "detailed_description": "<h1>Notas da Atualização</h1><p>Super ninja hero VR is now support the Oculus\r\n-- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- \r\nSuper ninja hero VR is now support Oculus Rift,  picking up your Touch and join the team!\r\nMelee weapons - Ninja blade come to the game.Defense with a casual smile and attack as aggreesive as fire .The road of hero, more exciting.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Hero, you are not alone!\r\n&quot;super ninja hero vr&quot; is a VR-FPS game(first-person shooting game) that developed by Wuhan Firegame Co.,Ltd..Variety of scenes with cool fighting, strong cunning enemies and smart boss.Taking up your arms to begin a legend.\r\n\r\n--Weapon:\r\n  Hidden blade:suitable for beginners,simple and crude. Aim at the enemy, pulling  the trigger and biu biu biu....\r\n  Bow:Completely imitate true archery,enjoying the pleasure of slay.\r\n\r\n--Battle:\r\n  Flight with claw? Yes\r\n  Fight face-to-face?Yes\r\n  Escape by a walk?Yes\r\n  Shoot behind barrier?Yes\r\n\r\n--Enemies:\r\nBrutal Shadow Evil and sexy Tengu is waiting for you with a team of minions in their secret base.\r\nSo\r\n  Are you ready?\r\n\r\nFor more enjoyment,join us.",
